        "original_id": "d8f83e70-fc36-54f6-965a-9662c6fb73fb",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jaume Collet-Serra, Liam Neeson, Julianne Moore, Michelle Dockery, Lupita Nyong'o, Scoot McNairy, Andrew Rona\n- Films: Non-Stop, Project X, Equilibrium, Scream, Scary Movie\n- Television Series: Downton Abbey\n- Topics: film production, acting awards\n\nFacts:\n- Downton Abbey aired from 2010 to 2015, and Michelle Dockery was widely known for playing Lady Mary Crawley in the series.\n- Michelle Dockery received three consecutive Emmy Award nominations for Outstanding Lead Actress in a Drama Series and one Golden Globe nomination for Downton Abbey.\n- Non-Stop is a 2014 American mystery action thriller film directed by Jaume Collet-Serra.\n- Non-Stop stars Liam Neeson, Julianne Moore, Michelle Dockery, Lupita Nyong'o, and Scoot McNairy.\n- Andrew Rona has produced over 100 films, including Non-Stop, Project X, Equilibrium, Scream, and Scary Movie.",
